  "notes": [
    "Qty 59 as published (no section counts given).",
    "Starting cards as posted under 'STARTING': the Objective ('Ralltiir ops'), Ralltiir, Prepared Defenses ('Prepared Defences'), Imperial Arrest Order, There Is No Try and Oppressive Enforcement; these count toward the total. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
    "Oppressive Enforcement and Secret Plans are the Special Edition Effects in November 2000 (not the Reflections III Defensive Shields).",
    "Posted 'Docking bay' names no specific site (the draft guessed Coruscant: Docking Bay); left UNKNOWN as posted.",
    "Section headers ('Loacations', 'Charactors', 'Ships', 'Interups', 'Effects', 'Weapons', 'Admerals Orders') are labels, not cards.",
    "Posted 'Vader Saber x2' dested Vader's Lightsaber (could be one Vader's Lightsaber and one Darth Vader's Lightsaber); 'Maras Saber' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Bossk In Bus' Bossk In Hound's Tooth; 'Boba in S1' Boba Fett In Slave I; 'Dengar in P1' Dengar In Punishing One; 'Zuckuss in MH' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter.",
    "Posted 'Commander Merrijk' dested Commander Merrejk; 'Major Marguand' Major Marquand; 'U-3P0' U-3PO (Yoo-Threepio); 'Admeral Chimaneu' Admiral Chiraneau; 'Kiffix' Kiffex; 'Twillik Advisor' Twi'lek Advisor."
